{"id":"0f325d95c7cd0f32","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-computable-invariance.md","title":"可计算置换不变的集合性质","display":"df-computable-invariance — 可计算置换不变的集合性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-computable-invariance","aliases":["20-df-computable-invariance"],"display":"df-computable-invariance — 可计算置换不变的集合性质","chapter":"1","section":"1.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 1.7.1(ii)","source_printed_pages":[19],"source_pdf_pages":[55],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-computable-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-computable-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-invariance — 可计算置换不变的集合性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.7.1(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr K\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathscr K\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> 为集合性质的外延类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompPerm}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompPerm}\\)</span> 为上游定义的可计算置换谓词。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompInvariant}(\\mathscr K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\Rightarrow(A\\in\\mathscr K\\Longleftrightarrow p[A]\\in\\mathscr K)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompInvariant}(\\mathscr K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\Rightarrow(A\\in\\mathscr K\\Longleftrightarrow p[A]\\in\\mathscr K)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逆置换可计算，所以单向保持与这里的双向式等价。基数、c.e. 性、可计算性是此类性质；指定某个自然数是否属于 A 不是。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr K\">\\(\\mathscr K\\)</span> 是幂集的子集；集合性质的外延表示不额外引入对象语言公式编码。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.7.1(ii)；印刷页 19；PDF 第 55 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathscr K\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompPerm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompInvariant}(\\mathscr K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\Rightarrow(A\\in\\mathscr K\\Longleftrightarrow p[A]\\in\\mathscr K)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathscr K","display":false}],"bytes":1460,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2d6dc64668d77215"]}